  "content": {
    "title": "Illinois vs VCU score, highlights: Stojakovic, Wagler lead Illini to Sweet 16",
    "text": "Updated March 21, 2026, 10:23 p.m. ETFollow all of Saturday's NCAA Tournament second round games with USA TODAY Sports' live updates.Maybe no team has looked as dominant so far this Men's NCAA Tournament than Illinois.After the Illini demolished Penn, 105-70, in the first round, they followed it up with a 76-55 win over No. 11 VCU in Saturday's second round.Freshman star Keaton Wagler had a slow start, scoring just one point in the first half. But Andrej Stojakovic (yes, Peja's son) picked up the slack with 16 first-half points off the bench.Then Wagler picked up the pace after the break and the Illini didn’t let up. Wagler scored 13 of his 14 points in the second half. Tomislav Ivisic had 14 points and 11 rebounds and Stojakovic finished with a game-high 21.The Illini were too quick, too physical and too big for the Rams, who lost freshman guard Nyk Lewis less than a minute into the game with an ankle injury. Lewis, the Atlantic 10 Rookie of the Year, scored 16 points in the first round win over North Carolina, and his loss was certainly felt.No. 3 Illinois advances to Houston for the Sweet 16 where it will face No. 2 Houston, who beat Texas A&M on Saturday.Here's how the Illini beat the Rams: Illinois vs VCU final score Illinois 76, VCU 55TEAMS1H2HFVCU282755Illinois354176 Keaton Wagler is heating upThe Illinois freshman drills another 3 and has 12 of his 13 points here in the second half. VCU finally has a free throw attempt!At the 6:24 mark of the second half. Jadrian Tracey finishes through contact, but misses the free throw. Illinois up 63-44 with 6:22 left. Oh my! Zvonimir Ivisic with a monster slam!He blocks a dunk attempt at one end, runs out in transition and then absolutely throws one down.Then Kylan Boswell hits a 3 and the Illini are cooking.\"That is Air Croatia,\" Ian Eagle quips.Phil Martelli Jr. gets a tech. His Rams still don't have a free throw. Keaton Wagler finally hits a 3Keaton Wagler hit his first 3-pointer of the game (1 of 6) to give Illinois its largest lead of the game at 43-30.VCU still hasn't attempted a free throw five minutes into the second half. HALFTIME: Illinois 35, VCU 28Illinois rallies with a 9-0 run of their own to regain the lead after VCU took its first lead of the game on a Terrence Hill jumper with 3 minutes left in the first half.Illinois' Andrej Stojakovic (yes, Peja's son) has 16 points off the bench to lead all scorers. VCU's active hands on defense changing momentumDavid Mirkovic picks up his second foul on a moving screen, and the Rams' defense is causing havoc for the Illini now.VCU comes back to tie with a 10-0 run. Nyk Lewis injury update: Rams freshman outNyk Lewis returned to the bench but with his shoe off and a bag of ice wrapped around his ankle.VCU coach Phil Martelli Jr. told CBS' Tracy Wolfson, \"It's not one guy. We're not built around one guy. It's a big loss, but guys will step up.\" Can Rams fly? The answer is yes. Illinois' height a factor early vs VCUIllinois' height is giving the Rams some problems. VCU struggling with 7-1 Tomislav Ivisic, 6-9 David Mirkovic and 6-7 Andrej Stojakovic.Illini are out rebounding the Rams 13-8 so far, and VCU has had an ugly shooting start 5 of 19 (22%), but have hit back-to-back 3s.VCU's Nyk Lewis injury: Back to locker room, getting x-raysLess than a minute into the game, Lewis goes down after landing awkwardly on a rebound attempt. He had to be helped off the floor by VCU training staff.The Rams freshman is averaging 8.9 points, 4.6 rebounds a game. He scored 16 in the first round win over North Carolina. Tough early break for VCU.Lewis was taken back to the locker room and is getting x-rays, according to CBS' Tracy Wolfson. Illinois vs VCU startersVCULazar DJokovicBarry EvansNyk LewisBrandon JenningsJadrian TraceyIllinoisDavid MirkovicJake DavisKeaton WaglerTomislav IvisicKylan Boswell What time is Illinois vs VCU?Updated time: 8:15 p.m. ET, Saturday. (originally set for 7:50 p.m.)What channel is Illinois vs VCU? How to watch, streaming infoThe game is airing on CBS, streaming via Paramount+.Illinois vs VCU predictionEhsan Kassim: IllinoisJordan Mendoza: IllinoisJohn Leuzzi: VCUBlake Schuster: IllinoisMoneyline: Illinois (-580)Spread: Illinois (-10.5)Over/under total: 153.5Is Andrej Stojakovic related to Peja Stojakovic?Yes, Peja is his dad. And at the game in the stands.Keaton Wagler 2026 NBA Draft mock draft predictionAtlanta Hawks, pick No. 7.Kalbrosky's Analysis:After trading away Trae Young, the Hawks could find their point guard of the future in Illinois standout Keaton Wagler using a first-round pick they received from the Pelicans. The 19-year-old guard scored 46 points while shooting 9-of-11 on 3-pointers against No. 12 Purdue on Jan. 24. He projects as one of the best 3-point shooters in this class, shooting 41.0 percent from beyond the arc as a freshman this year. The Big Ten Rookie of the Year is a cerebral basketball player who is also averaging 4.9 rebounds and 4.3 assists per game this season. The 19-year-old guard scored 46 points while shooting 9-of-11 on 3-pointers against No. 12 Purdue on Jan. 24. He projects as one of the best 3-point shooters in this class, shooting 41.0 percent from beyond the arc as a freshman this year. The Big Ten Rookie of the Year is a cerebral basketball player who is also averaging 4.9 rebounds and 4.3 assists per game this season.See USA TODAY's full mock draft hereKeaton Wagler stats(all stats as of March 15)17.9 points per game4.8 rebounds per game4.4 assists per game44.6% field goal percentage40.2% three-point field goal percentage",
